  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"328\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"326\">About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"723\"><strong data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"336\">URU</strong> stands for <em data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"364\">“You Are You.”</em> We create handcrafted scented candles that celebrate individuality, self-awareness, and inner peace. Each candle is poured into a uniquely designed <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"527\">cement jar (</strong>minimal, elegant, and timeless) meant to be reused and cherished. Our candles are made from <strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"658\">natural, eco-friendly materials</strong>, designed to bring calm, beauty, and meaning into every space.</p><hr data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"728\"><h3 data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"764\"><strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"762\">What makes us different:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"1150\">URU embodies&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"794\">quiet luxury (</strong>understated, refined, and deeply personal).<br data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\">Every element, from the rough cement texture of the jar to the <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"945\">black-on-black sustainable packaging</strong>, is intentionally crafted to reflect elegance and authenticity. Beyond design, each purchase contributes to <strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1094\">providing meals for children in need</strong>, allowing our customers to enjoy beauty with purpose.</p><hr data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1155\"><h3 data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1189\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1339\">Affiliates earn&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1226\">20% commission</strong> on every purchase made through their unique link or coupon code.<br data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1294\">As performance grows, commissions increase:</p><ul data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1424\"><li data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1381\"><p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1381\"><strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1360\">25% commission</strong> after 50 purchases</p></li><li data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1424\"><p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1424\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1402\">30% commission</strong> after 100 purchases</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1546\">Affiliates also receive a <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1473\">15% discount code</strong> to share with their audience, encouraging engagement and repeat sales.</p><hr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1551\"><h3 data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1581\"><strong data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1579\">How to promote us:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1611\">Share your love for URU by:</p><ul data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1948\"><li data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1684\"><p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1684\">Adding your affiliate link to your <strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1662\">Instagram</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1682\">TikTok bios</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1748\"><p data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1748\">Featuring URU candles in your <strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1746\">stories, posts, or videos</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1847\"><p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1847\">Sharing your <strong data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1781\">discount code</strong> with your followers to help them save and discover our products</p></li><li data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1948\"><p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1948\">Highlighting the <strong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1927\">luxurious design, natural scents, and mindful philosophy</strong> behind each candle</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2078\">We encourage creativity, unboxing videos, cozy room setups, or aesthetic flat-lays all capture the spirit of URU beautifully.</p><hr data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2083\"><h3 data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2113\"><strong data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2111\">Other information:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2411\">URU candles are ideal for audiences who value <strong data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2211\">aesthetic decor, self-care, and mindful living.</strong><br data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\">We provide affiliates with visuals, brand guidelines, and personalized support to help you succeed.<br data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2316\">Our mission is simple: to remind everyone that <em data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2409\">You Are You — unique, beautiful, and enough.</em></p></div>",
